# Protects the project policy package. Add these lines to the repository's CODEOWNERS and replace the team with your Enterprise Governance team.
# With branch protection requiring a code owner review, nobody on the project can change what the project follows by editing these files.
/.claude/skills/project-policy/ @your-org/enterprise-governance
/.workbench/policy.lock.json @your-org/enterprise-governance
/.workbench/CODEOWNERS.snippet @your-org/enterprise-governance
